WEBVTT

01:36.259 --> 01:41.050
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.530 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 14]

01:44.350 --> 01:45.410
Bad news! Bad news!

01:47.509 --> 01:48.120
Bad news!

01:48.400 --> 01:50.080
Zuoqiu and Yuhan are fighting.

01:50.080 --> 01:51.160
We can't stop them.

01:51.200 --> 01:52.860
Yiren, please go check it out!

01:54.400 --> 01:54.930
This way!

01:57.070 --> 01:57.640
Wait.

02:04.280 --> 02:04.920
Yiren!

02:04.940 --> 02:06.200
W-What's happening?

02:06.200 --> 02:07.600
Go find Zuoqiu and Yuhan.

02:16.040 --> 02:16.790
Miss Tang.

02:25.150 --> 02:26.240
Xiao Qiushui.

02:29.030 --> 02:31.560
You dare play such tricks
right under my nose?

02:31.800 --> 02:33.200
At this critical moment,

02:33.240 --> 02:36.100
do you still want to fight for
the Young Leadership?

02:42.400 --> 02:44.840
Yiren, that's not what I meant.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.150
Please don't misunderstand.

02:46.150 --> 02:47.350
Misunderstand what?

02:47.620 --> 02:49.000
You think just because you have the token,

02:49.000 --> 02:51.400
the disciples of Huanhua Sect
will obey you?

02:51.400 --> 02:52.260
Let me tell you,

02:52.680 --> 02:54.710
the Tiger Guards
have always been under my command.

02:54.710 --> 02:56.190
They've been through
thick and thin with me.

02:56.190 --> 02:57.820
You think a mere Sect Leader's Token

02:57.820 --> 02:59.350
will make them respect you?

03:01.400 --> 03:02.080
Yiren,

03:03.580 --> 03:06.790
I'm well aware of your authority
in the Xiao family.

03:07.710 --> 03:08.960
I don't care

03:08.960 --> 03:10.520
about the Young Leadership position.

03:10.520 --> 03:12.590
But when it comes to saving Sword Manor,

03:12.590 --> 03:13.870
you must listen to me.

03:14.190 --> 03:16.520
Give me the Sect Leader's Token right now.

03:16.590 --> 03:17.960
After I save our parents,

03:17.960 --> 03:19.079
I'll return it to you immediately.

03:19.079 --> 03:20.150
Even if it's just for a day,

03:20.150 --> 03:21.530
or half a day, please!

03:21.560 --> 03:22.560
-Qiushui.
-What?

03:23.310 --> 03:24.870
I shouldn't be scolding you

03:24.870 --> 03:26.280
nor do I have the right to.

03:26.750 --> 03:28.150
But Yiren has been

03:28.310 --> 03:30.240
working tirelessly for your sake.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.680
He finally cleaned up your mess

03:33.079 --> 03:35.190
to persuade Mr. Qu
to help the Sword Manor.

03:35.190 --> 03:36.960
At this time,

03:36.960 --> 03:38.800
why are you fighting
for the Young Leadership?

03:38.800 --> 03:40.200
Can you face your parents

03:40.710 --> 03:41.840
and the Xiao family?

03:41.960 --> 03:42.710
What?

03:44.430 --> 03:46.490
Qu Hanshan wants to save Sword Manor?

03:49.430 --> 03:50.000
Yiren,

03:51.470 --> 03:52.910
he's from the Power Gang.

03:53.870 --> 03:55.470
Don't be fooled by him.

03:55.470 --> 03:56.190
Enough.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.160
Right now, we need his help.

03:58.240 --> 03:59.640
Don't make things worse.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.590
I've been in the martial world for years.

04:01.590 --> 04:02.840
If he had any suspicious behavior,

04:02.840 --> 04:04.040
I would have noticed.

04:04.150 --> 04:05.470
If he's really guilty,

04:05.750 --> 04:08.240
we can confront him face to face that day.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.030
No way.

04:10.800 --> 04:11.400
No way!

04:12.150 --> 04:12.840
Move.

04:13.150 --> 04:13.550
Hey...

04:18.630 --> 04:21.160
Qu Hanshan wants nothing more
than to silence Xiao Qiushui.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.800
How can we send him into the tiger's den?

04:22.800 --> 04:23.600
That's right.

04:23.800 --> 04:25.430
Yiren, let me ask you.

04:26.000 --> 04:27.600
Since he's already exposed,

04:27.920 --> 04:29.580
why is he putting on this show?

04:29.830 --> 04:32.880
He clearly wants to kill me!

04:36.240 --> 04:38.830
Don't worry. I'll protect you that day.

04:39.200 --> 04:40.560
Besides, other sects

04:40.560 --> 04:42.090
will be there as witnesses.

04:42.480 --> 04:43.620
With so many people present,

04:43.620 --> 04:44.540
why fear him?

04:44.950 --> 04:46.800
If he really has something to hide,

04:46.800 --> 04:49.200
we can seize the opportunity
when it comes.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.830
In short, this matter is settled.

04:50.830 --> 04:52.270
Everything is set and ready.

04:52.270 --> 04:53.930
Don't cause any more trouble.

04:58.870 --> 04:59.510
Yiren,

05:00.310 --> 05:01.310
it doesn't matter

05:01.310 --> 05:03.370
if you don't believe me or the others.

05:04.270 --> 05:05.270
But let me ask you.

05:06.560 --> 05:08.000
You should believe

05:08.950 --> 05:10.390
Mr. Du Yueshan,

05:11.120 --> 05:13.050
the Mengxiang Sect Leader, right?

05:13.310 --> 05:15.510
Qu Hanshan imprisoned Mr. Du for years.

05:15.950 --> 05:18.010
We just rescued him from the dungeon.

05:18.600 --> 05:21.600
If Du Yueshan can testify
against Qu Hanshan,

05:22.240 --> 05:24.360
then you should at least listen,
shouldn't you?

05:24.360 --> 05:27.360
What? Mr. Qu imprisoned Mr. Du?

05:28.950 --> 05:30.410
What kind of rumor is this?

05:30.510 --> 05:31.190
Qiushui.

05:31.870 --> 05:33.430
You said the Free-Spirited Sage
was killed,

05:33.430 --> 05:35.290
yet they appeared at Bishan Sect.

05:35.390 --> 05:37.600
Now you're changing your story to Mr. Du.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.730
Qiushui, please stop messing around.

05:40.560 --> 05:42.159
I'm really not messing around.

05:42.159 --> 05:44.480
Why don't any of you believe what I say?

05:44.920 --> 05:45.680
Wait here.

05:45.920 --> 05:46.920
I'll bring Mr. Du.

05:47.070 --> 05:47.830
We'll go too.

05:51.600 --> 05:52.310
Yiren!

05:52.920 --> 05:55.120
Let's see what troubles you can stir up.

05:55.430 --> 05:56.310
Qiushui.

05:57.120 --> 05:57.720
Yiren.

05:59.120 --> 05:59.800
Yiren!

06:00.680 --> 06:01.510
Keep an eye on him for me.

06:01.510 --> 06:01.920
Yes.

06:02.160 --> 06:02.630
Yiren!

06:04.000 --> 06:04.510
Yiren!

06:06.680 --> 06:07.390
Yiren!

06:23.150 --> 06:26.610
[Top Fairness Forest]

06:25.360 --> 06:26.890
Here, please have some tea.

06:27.120 --> 06:30.270
Please.

06:30.360 --> 06:31.160
Come, please.

06:50.070 --> 06:50.700
Mr. Qu.

06:53.830 --> 06:54.630
Chief Sikong.

06:55.020 --> 06:57.140
[Master Xiao of Yanzi Sect]
[Sikong Xue, Chief of Tiancan Gang]

06:55.800 --> 06:56.560
Master Xiao.

06:57.920 --> 06:58.830
Master Ge.

07:00.070 --> 07:00.680
Miss Weng.

07:00.490 --> 07:02.170
[Master Ge of Divine Blade Hall]
[Weng Yueying of Bishan Sect]

07:07.800 --> 07:09.530
These people behind you are...

07:10.240 --> 07:12.360
These five are
the Five Tigers of Guangling.

07:12.360 --> 07:14.370
The other friends from the martial world

07:14.370 --> 07:16.040
are also renowned masters

07:16.120 --> 07:17.630
from the Guangling region.

07:17.630 --> 07:18.390
Since today,

07:18.630 --> 07:20.830
all fellow martial artists
have gathered here,

07:20.830 --> 07:22.430
I, Xiao, will speak frankly.

07:22.720 --> 07:23.720
Today, I've come,

07:23.920 --> 07:25.870
first, to bring my younger brother

07:26.120 --> 07:27.380
to apologize to Mr. Qu.

07:28.040 --> 07:30.190
We hope to resolve
our previous misunderstanding.

07:30.190 --> 07:32.190
Second, I hope everyone

07:32.630 --> 07:34.470
can come to the aid of the Huanhua Sect.

07:34.470 --> 07:35.790
As they say, all righteous sects

07:35.790 --> 07:37.310
are branches of the same tree.

07:37.310 --> 07:38.830
For your generous assistance,

07:38.830 --> 07:41.690
the Xiao family will surely
repay you in the future.

07:49.430 --> 07:50.070
Qiushui.

07:50.720 --> 07:52.380
Hurry and apologize to Mr. Qu.

07:58.270 --> 07:58.830
Wait.

08:01.870 --> 08:04.200
It's not that I can't help
the Xiao family.

08:05.360 --> 08:07.560
But some matters must be settled first.

08:08.600 --> 08:11.040
Today, I've invited fellow martial artists
to Top Fairness Forest

08:11.040 --> 08:13.560
in hopes that everyone can be witnesses.

08:14.310 --> 08:15.310
I am someone

08:15.600 --> 08:17.920
who never dwells on
personal gains or losses.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.160
But if certain people

08:19.240 --> 08:21.950
commit acts against
the martial world's principles,

08:21.950 --> 08:23.610
I will not let them off easily.

08:27.070 --> 08:30.310
So, what I'm about to say

08:30.750 --> 08:33.750
is nothing personal
against Young Master Xiao.

08:36.030 --> 08:37.230
Do you all believe me?

08:39.390 --> 08:42.870
Mr. Qu is a master
of both skill and virtue,

08:43.320 --> 08:44.720
always fair and upright,

08:44.910 --> 08:46.600
renowned throughout the land.

08:46.600 --> 08:48.390
We certainly believe you.

08:49.200 --> 08:52.530
-Please speak freely, Mr. Qu.
-Please speak freely, Mr. Qu.

08:56.000 --> 08:57.510
Xiao Qiushui, tell me.

08:58.200 --> 09:00.510
Why did you collude with
Northern Wasteland spies,

09:00.510 --> 09:02.570
betraying the martial world of Daxi?

09:18.240 --> 09:19.970
Mr. Qu, what makes you say this?

09:20.120 --> 09:21.320
You should ask him.

09:21.790 --> 09:24.390
He not only broke into my residence
and slandered me,

09:24.390 --> 09:25.910
but also conspired with accomplices

09:25.910 --> 09:28.840
to rescue a Northern Wasteland spy
from the dungeon.

09:44.320 --> 09:45.270
Qu Hanshan.

09:49.600 --> 09:51.660
All the way here, I've been wondering

09:52.440 --> 09:55.120
what you'd do to me
if I exposed your identity

09:56.030 --> 09:57.390
as a Power Gang lackey.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.390
Turns out

10:04.390 --> 10:06.150
you want to frame me
with the false accusation

10:06.150 --> 10:08.030
of colluding with the Northern Wasteland.

10:08.030 --> 10:09.440
Your so-called fairness

10:10.580 --> 10:12.700
truly turns lies into facts.

10:17.550 --> 10:18.150
Everyone,

10:18.910 --> 10:20.550
in the secret dungeon of Qu's residence,

10:20.550 --> 10:21.910
I witnessed with my own eyes

10:21.910 --> 10:22.790
that Qu Hanshan

10:24.240 --> 10:26.700
had imprisoned and tortured
Mr. Du Yueshan.

10:27.080 --> 10:29.270
He failed to get the
Mengxiang Sword Technique,

10:29.270 --> 10:33.630
and now, he falsely accuses Mr. Du
of being a Northern Wasteland spy.

10:36.480 --> 10:38.440
You really should give Mr. Du

10:39.390 --> 10:41.720
and the martial world a fair explanation!

10:43.440 --> 10:45.970
Xiao Qiushui,
don't spread baseless rumors.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.030
Everyone knows

10:47.240 --> 10:49.600
Mr. Qu and Du Yueshan
are close friends.

10:50.030 --> 10:51.690
He would never do such a thing.

10:51.840 --> 10:53.320
Because his true identity

10:53.670 --> 10:55.600
is the Sword King of the Power Gang!

11:03.630 --> 11:04.960
Mr. Gu Junshan

11:05.630 --> 11:07.790
was killed by you in your courtyard.

11:08.600 --> 11:12.390
So today, I must expose your true nature.

11:12.960 --> 11:14.820
Qiushui, stop talking nonsense.

11:15.240 --> 11:16.030
I've told you

11:16.200 --> 11:18.240
Mr. Gu is alive and well.

11:18.750 --> 11:21.080
Gu didn't visit today,

11:21.510 --> 11:24.200
and I would never imprison Du.

11:24.910 --> 11:27.480
Only one person has been imprisoned
in the Qu Residence dungeon.

11:27.480 --> 11:30.480
That person was a subordinate
of the Northern Wasteland King Helian Yan,

11:30.480 --> 11:31.480
Yuchi Qing.

11:31.910 --> 11:33.870
I, along with Miss Weng from Bishan Sect

11:33.870 --> 11:36.480
and the Master of Divine Blade Hall
captured him together.

11:36.480 --> 11:38.030
We tried to extract

11:38.030 --> 11:39.750
information about
the Northern Wasteland traitor's plans.

11:39.750 --> 11:42.600
But unexpectedly, you freed him.

11:43.000 --> 11:43.840
You're lying!

11:50.360 --> 11:51.480
Mr. Du Yueshan...

11:54.550 --> 11:56.680
Mr. Du Yueshan was tortured terribly!

11:57.390 --> 11:58.600
Before he escaped,

11:58.840 --> 12:01.080
he taught me
the Mengxiang Sword Technique.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.240
If you just wait,

12:03.360 --> 12:04.600
my friends

12:05.630 --> 12:07.840
will bring Mr. Du Yueshan here

12:08.720 --> 12:09.670
to confront him!

12:14.960 --> 12:15.910
Mr. Qu and I

12:16.150 --> 12:18.410
did indeed capture Yuchi Qing together.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.600
But to say Xiao Qiushui set him free,

12:20.960 --> 12:22.420
there's no real evidence.

12:22.960 --> 12:25.290
Mr. Qu, there must be a misunderstanding.

12:25.390 --> 12:27.630
Qiushui's temperament
is indeed somewhat mischievous,

12:27.630 --> 12:31.230
but he would never release
a Northern Wasteland spy.

12:33.550 --> 12:35.690
Seeing you speak with such conviction,

12:35.690 --> 12:37.150
even I almost believe you.

12:37.630 --> 12:39.840
However, unfortunately,

12:40.000 --> 12:41.730
facts speak louder than words.

12:41.840 --> 12:43.550
At the place where Yuchi Qing escaped,

12:43.550 --> 12:44.780
I clearly saw the mark

12:44.800 --> 12:46.780
of the
Eight-Directions Thunder Slash technique.

12:46.780 --> 12:48.640
Xiao Qiushui, I'd like to ask you.

12:48.910 --> 12:51.390
Did you really learn
the Mengxiang Sword Technique

12:51.390 --> 12:53.520
or was it Yuchi Qing's signature move,

12:54.030 --> 12:56.090
the Thirteen Blood-Drinking Saber?

12:56.630 --> 12:58.090
You're truly despicable.

12:59.150 --> 12:59.870
Master Ge.

13:02.080 --> 13:05.670
The Divine Blade Hall has also
received guidance from Mr. Du.

13:06.320 --> 13:08.910
Let me see for myself

13:09.630 --> 13:12.480
your so-called Mengxiang Sword Technique.

13:17.600 --> 13:20.630
Qiushui, prove it to me then.

13:54.770 --> 13:57.460
I recognize Master Ge's technique.

13:57.750 --> 14:00.080
It's Mr. Du's Mengxiang Sword Technique.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.930
He's just adapted
the sword skill for the saber.

14:03.360 --> 14:04.020
Brilliant!

14:04.670 --> 14:06.600
But what Young Master Xiao is using

14:06.750 --> 14:08.880
is not the Mengxiang Sword Technique.

14:11.670 --> 14:14.700
Xiao Qiushui's technique
feels more like saber skills

14:14.700 --> 14:15.760
than sword skills.

14:28.600 --> 14:30.440
Qiushui is clearly using saber skills,

14:30.440 --> 14:31.550
not sword skills.

14:40.390 --> 14:40.990
Master Ge.

14:43.120 --> 14:45.000
Master Ge, are you alright?

14:47.840 --> 14:49.170
Qiushui is so powerful.

14:55.960 --> 14:58.600
What an impressive
Eight-Directions Thunder Slash!

14:58.600 --> 14:59.480
Xiao Qiushui,

15:00.150 --> 15:02.960
what you used wasn't
Mengxiang Sword Technique at all.

15:02.960 --> 15:06.360
It was clearly Yuchi Qing's
Thirteen Blood-Drinking Saber!

15:06.360 --> 15:08.360
That's right. I recognized it too.

15:09.150 --> 15:10.630
His final move

15:10.910 --> 15:13.150
was the killing technique
of the Thirteen Blood-Drinking Saber,

15:13.150 --> 15:15.280
the Eight-Directions Thunder Slash.

15:21.410 --> 15:22.250
Impossible.

15:33.670 --> 15:35.960
Have you all conspired together?

15:36.600 --> 15:37.910
Words can lie,

15:38.390 --> 15:39.790
but martial arts cannot.

15:40.030 --> 15:41.960
I once fought with Yuchi Qing

15:42.440 --> 15:45.420
and I would recognize his style
no matter what.

15:52.840 --> 15:54.510
This is the mark

15:54.630 --> 15:57.830
that the Eight-Directions Thunder Slash
left on my body.

16:00.030 --> 16:00.820
Xiao Yiren.

16:01.440 --> 16:04.100
Weren't you there
with your father, Xiao Xilou,

16:04.270 --> 16:07.030
when I was seriously injured
by Yuchi Qing?

16:08.510 --> 16:09.840
Don't you recognize it?

16:10.360 --> 16:11.080
Yiren?

16:13.480 --> 16:14.280
That's right.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.670
It was indeed
the Thirteen Blood-Drinking Saber.

16:25.360 --> 16:26.550
How could this be?

16:27.360 --> 16:28.240
Xiao Qiushui.

16:28.750 --> 16:30.950
Your brother has no reason to lie to you.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.610
What else do you have to say?

16:33.360 --> 16:35.630
You falsely accused Mr. Qu
of being from the Power Gang,

16:35.630 --> 16:37.720
when you're the real traitor!

16:42.480 --> 16:43.840
Qu Hanshan had set this trap

16:43.840 --> 16:45.080
for me long ago.

16:53.030 --> 16:53.630
Everyone,

16:54.390 --> 16:55.390
if someone

16:55.840 --> 16:57.120
in your sect learned

16:57.120 --> 16:58.750
unorthodox martial arts,

16:59.150 --> 17:00.750
how would you deal with them?

17:01.360 --> 17:03.480
Naturally, we would sever their tendons

17:03.480 --> 17:05.160
and forbid them
from practicing martial arts for life.

17:05.160 --> 17:05.750
No!

17:06.750 --> 17:08.589
Even if he learned
such techniques by mistake,

17:08.589 --> 17:09.640
it wasn't intentional.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.500
How can we punish him so severely?

17:11.680 --> 17:12.680
Qu Hanshan.

17:14.829 --> 17:16.230
You are truly cunning.

17:17.270 --> 17:19.000
Even if I know this saber skill,

17:19.200 --> 17:20.599
I've done nothing wrong,

17:20.960 --> 17:22.619
and I've never harmed anyone.

17:22.880 --> 17:25.010
If you want to destroy my martial arts,

17:26.000 --> 17:27.510
why go to such lengths?

17:28.550 --> 17:30.310
Enough. Don't speak now.

17:33.510 --> 17:34.110
Everyone,

17:34.640 --> 17:37.100
Qiushui must have been
deceived by villains

17:37.110 --> 17:38.000
and led astray.

17:38.550 --> 17:40.720
Even if he just used
Northern Wasteland techniques,

17:40.720 --> 17:41.980
he should be punished,

17:42.000 --> 17:42.860
but I guarantee

17:43.720 --> 17:45.450
he didn't do it intentionally.

17:45.470 --> 17:47.070
Since your brother arrived,

17:47.110 --> 17:49.070
not a single truthful word
has come from his mouth,

17:49.070 --> 17:50.480
yet you still defend him.

17:50.960 --> 17:53.590
Xiao Yiren, are you too involved
to see the truth,

17:53.590 --> 17:55.050
deceived by your brother?

17:55.480 --> 17:57.080
Or is it that your Xiao family

17:57.350 --> 18:00.550
has always had unclear ties
with the Northern Wasteland?

18:00.880 --> 18:01.680
Master Xiao,

18:02.270 --> 18:03.530
don't speak nonsense.

18:03.590 --> 18:05.350
Stop slandering my family!

18:08.790 --> 18:09.720
Mr. Du is here!

18:20.440 --> 18:21.240
Mr. Du,

18:21.680 --> 18:22.940
quickly tell everyone

18:23.310 --> 18:24.880
how this villain Qu Hanshan

18:25.160 --> 18:27.160
imprisoned and forced you.

18:33.510 --> 18:34.310
Yuchi Qing.

18:38.590 --> 18:39.520
What did you say?

18:40.270 --> 18:41.400
Please don't kill me.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.310
Don't kill me.

18:42.480 --> 18:43.880
Please don't kill me.

18:44.000 --> 18:45.330
I didn't mean to escape.

18:46.960 --> 18:47.720
It was him!

18:50.640 --> 18:53.030
[Yuchi Qing or the Northern Wasteland]

18:50.960 --> 18:54.720
He used the Hero Command Token to get
the Thirteen Blood-Drinking Saber.

18:54.720 --> 18:57.440
After escaping the dungeon,
he tried to silence me too.

18:57.440 --> 18:58.960
Fortunately, I ran fast enough.

18:58.960 --> 19:00.420
You're talking nonsense.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.750
You clearly claimed to be
Du Yueshan yourself.

19:02.750 --> 19:04.000
In order to escape through the waterway,

19:04.000 --> 19:05.750
you personally taught Xiao Qiushui
martial arts.

19:05.750 --> 19:07.410
How could you sling mud at him?

19:07.620 --> 19:09.070
I'm telling nothing but the truth!

19:09.070 --> 19:11.070
He does have the Hero Command Token!

19:11.200 --> 19:12.440
I saw it myself.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.720
Qiushui has the Hero Command Token?

19:20.310 --> 19:20.880
He has to hand it over.

19:20.880 --> 19:22.880
Right. We must make him hand it over.

19:24.270 --> 19:26.730
You're overly ambitious
at such a young age.

19:27.310 --> 19:30.830
How dare you think of seizing
the Hero Command Token for yourself.

19:30.830 --> 19:32.240
Hand it over now!

19:37.880 --> 19:39.210
I didn't take the token.

19:41.830 --> 19:43.760
He and Qu Hanshan are in collusion.

19:44.110 --> 19:45.960
Now, he's simply framing me.

19:46.480 --> 19:48.830
Take away this spy
for the Northern Wasteland.

19:48.830 --> 19:50.480
I-I...

19:50.480 --> 19:51.610
-Move!
-Let go of me!

19:52.440 --> 19:53.100
Let go of me!

19:53.440 --> 19:54.240
Xiao Qiushui,

19:54.510 --> 19:57.030
you just won't confess
until the chips are down.

19:57.030 --> 19:57.830
Liu Qianbian.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.720
The Hero Command Token truly exists.

20:12.720 --> 20:13.320
Everyone,

20:13.880 --> 20:15.610
here is the Hero Command Token.

20:18.830 --> 20:19.960
It really was on him.

20:21.400 --> 20:22.720
Such a token does exist!

20:22.720 --> 20:23.920
-That's the one.
-Yeah, right.

20:23.920 --> 20:25.520
It's the Hero Command Token.

20:26.310 --> 20:28.440
"Behold the divine token of mystery."

20:28.440 --> 20:30.500
“All heroes shall bow immediately.”

20:31.060 --> 20:33.260
This is exactly the Hero Command Token.

20:40.710 --> 20:43.580
Your two brothers are obviously shocked.

20:43.920 --> 20:47.450
I bet they didn't know
you secretly kept the token for yourself.

20:47.960 --> 20:48.750
What a shame.

20:49.110 --> 20:50.350
Who would've known a black sheep

20:50.350 --> 20:53.950
such as yourself is part of
the renowned Xiao family in Jinzhong?

21:01.350 --> 21:03.480
The Hero Command Token was never on me.

21:05.440 --> 21:06.100
It was taken

21:06.110 --> 21:08.000
by you, the Power Gang, long ago!

21:11.510 --> 21:14.770
To add to that, you staged
this ridiculous show to frame me.

21:15.400 --> 21:15.960
Enough!

21:21.590 --> 21:22.320
Big Brother!

21:28.030 --> 21:29.760
Your arrogance is no news to me.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.060
But I didn't expect

21:31.240 --> 21:33.440
such perfidious behavior from you!

21:36.270 --> 21:38.680
The Xiao family has preserved
its good reputation for a century.

21:38.680 --> 21:41.210
Your unscrupulous acts
are not to tolerated!

21:41.920 --> 21:42.640
Yiren...

21:51.880 --> 21:54.960
Everyone,
my younger brother is young and ignorant.

21:55.750 --> 21:58.750
I implore you to spare him this time.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.480
Today, I will

22:01.240 --> 22:02.510
cut off an arm of mine

22:03.240 --> 22:04.640
to atone for his mistake!

22:05.350 --> 22:06.440
-Yiren!
-Yiren!

22:07.200 --> 22:09.110
One must bear the consequences
of one's own doing.

22:09.110 --> 22:10.920
The one we plan to punish is Xiao Qiushui,

22:10.920 --> 22:11.920
not someone else.

22:12.110 --> 22:12.910
That's right.

22:13.790 --> 22:14.960
Yes. He has to be punished!

22:14.960 --> 22:15.920
This traitor must be punished!

22:15.920 --> 22:17.050
He must be punished!

22:17.110 --> 22:18.370
Don't let him get away!

22:18.830 --> 22:19.490
He's a mole!

22:19.610 --> 22:20.680
We, the Five Tigers of Guangling,

22:20.680 --> 22:22.270
will have this traitor punished!

22:22.270 --> 22:23.160
He has to be eliminated!

22:23.160 --> 22:24.690
Exterminate Xiao Qiushui!

22:26.480 --> 22:28.200
You can't deny learning
the Northern Wasteland's

22:28.200 --> 22:30.000
martial skills without permission

22:30.000 --> 22:31.680
and secretly keeping
the Hero Command Token for yourself.

22:31.680 --> 22:35.070
Today, you must
give the martial world an explanation.

22:36.270 --> 22:37.670
An explanation for what?

22:37.960 --> 22:39.360
Don't believe him, guys!

22:39.680 --> 22:40.280
Tang Fang!

22:48.510 --> 22:51.510
That Northern Wastelander admitted
he was Du Yueshan

22:51.680 --> 22:53.590
and that he tricked Xiao Qiushui
into learning martial skills from him.

22:53.590 --> 22:55.720
Those people cooked up the entire scheme

22:55.720 --> 22:58.480
exactly
because we revealed his true identity.

22:59.790 --> 23:02.350
You're distorting the truth
with that smart mouth of yours.

23:02.350 --> 23:04.150
Then I'll teach you a lesson too,

23:04.400 --> 23:06.000
Xiao Qiushui's accomplice.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.160
Hold on!

23:11.920 --> 23:14.250
Please refrain from further acts, Mr. Qu.

23:14.270 --> 23:15.070
I am Tang Song.

23:15.270 --> 23:16.480
The old madam sent me here

23:16.480 --> 23:18.030
to take Tang Fang back for punishment.

23:18.030 --> 23:19.560
Please do me a favor, Mr. Qu.

23:27.640 --> 23:30.480
Tang Sect and Xiao Qiushui
are not connected in any way.

23:30.480 --> 23:32.310
Tang Fang's misinterpreted your actions

23:32.310 --> 23:34.910
because she has been deceived
by Xiao Qiushui.

23:41.750 --> 23:43.750
Now that Miss Tang is also a victim,

23:44.240 --> 23:47.040
it'd be best for her
to be disciplined by Tang Sect.

23:49.030 --> 23:49.680
Tang Fang,

23:50.110 --> 23:52.370
come back to Tang Sect with us right away.

23:52.790 --> 23:53.720
I'm not leaving.

24:06.770 --> 24:09.370
Sorry for all the trouble, everyone.
Goodbye.

24:13.200 --> 24:15.270
It's better for Tang Fang to be taken away

24:15.270 --> 24:17.670
by Tang Sect
than be captured by Qu Hanshan.

24:17.830 --> 24:19.690
I must find a way to get out of this.

24:20.110 --> 24:23.200
Xiao Qiushui, it's time we dealt with you.

24:29.510 --> 24:31.040
I won't admit to the offense

24:31.880 --> 24:33.080
that I didn't commit.

24:33.590 --> 24:34.550
I will prove

24:35.200 --> 24:35.960
I'm innocent

24:37.830 --> 24:39.760
of what I've been accused of today.

24:49.960 --> 24:51.560
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

25:10.830 --> 25:12.830
I should've been stricter with you,

25:13.200 --> 25:16.350
or you wouldn't have made
such a serious mistake today!

25:16.790 --> 25:19.390
Mr. Xiao, Big Brother
has really been wronged.

25:19.440 --> 25:20.770
I beg you to believe him.

25:21.720 --> 25:22.480
Shinian,

25:23.190 --> 25:24.680
take down the third young master!

25:24.680 --> 25:25.200
Yes!

25:33.510 --> 25:35.170
This matter only concerns me.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.400
You two stay away.

25:37.830 --> 25:38.560
Big Brother!

25:38.840 --> 25:39.350
Big Brother...

25:39.350 --> 25:40.030
Stand back!

25:52.590 --> 25:55.440
Yiren, let me go.

25:56.640 --> 25:58.770
I swear I'll prove my innocence to you.

25:59.200 --> 25:59.880
Shut up!

26:05.510 --> 26:08.160
Mr. Qu, Xiao Qiushui from Huanhua Sect

26:08.720 --> 26:09.920
is now under control.

26:09.960 --> 26:12.680
I guarantee
he won't stir up trouble again.

26:13.550 --> 26:16.310
Please allow me to take him back
to the Xiao Residence,

26:16.310 --> 26:18.240
so we can decide what to do with him.

26:18.790 --> 26:20.240
For all of Xiao Qiushui's wrongdoing,

26:20.240 --> 26:21.680
there is irrefutable evidence.

26:21.680 --> 26:23.160
Are you still trying to cover for him?

26:23.160 --> 26:25.960
Do you want the Xiao family's reputation
to be ruined or what?

26:25.960 --> 26:28.090
With such a black sheep in your family,

26:28.270 --> 26:30.330
you choose not to take a clear stance.

26:30.440 --> 26:31.880
What kind of message are you sending?

26:31.880 --> 26:34.410
Will anyone opt to
help the Xiao family again?

26:34.750 --> 26:36.550
Mr. Xiao, you heard what he said.

26:36.550 --> 26:38.240
Xiao Qiushui has to be punished

26:38.240 --> 26:39.370
and banished today,

26:39.720 --> 26:41.480
or I'm afraid nobody in the martial world

26:41.480 --> 26:43.880
will agree to extend aid
to the Xiao family.

26:44.110 --> 26:46.110
I thought you knew what was at stake.

26:50.440 --> 26:52.370
You plotted against me step by step

26:53.040 --> 26:54.720
just to silence me.

26:54.750 --> 26:55.440
Shut up!

26:56.510 --> 26:57.480
At this point,

26:57.720 --> 26:59.380
won't you stop being stubborn

26:59.400 --> 27:00.830
and making more mistakes?

27:00.830 --> 27:01.920
Are you really going to
disregard the reputations

27:01.920 --> 27:03.920
of Huanhua Sect and the Xiao family?

27:05.000 --> 27:05.680
Yiren,

27:08.400 --> 27:10.590
you'd rather believe others' lies

27:12.480 --> 27:14.480
than your own brother's words?

27:29.000 --> 27:29.540
Big Brother!

27:29.540 --> 27:31.200
Think about the greater good!

27:41.350 --> 27:43.720
I will remove your disguise someday

27:44.750 --> 27:46.960
and let everyone see who you really are.

27:57.640 --> 27:58.370
Big Brother!

28:14.960 --> 28:15.760
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

28:15.760 --> 28:18.070
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

28:18.090 --> 28:22.800
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

28:23.060 --> 28:25.410
♪ The wind blows ♪

28:25.440 --> 28:29.880
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

28:30.480 --> 28:32.930
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

28:32.950 --> 28:35.420
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

28:35.440 --> 28:38.550
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

28:39.240 --> 28:46.520
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

28:39.350 --> 28:40.080
Big Brother,

28:49.000 --> 28:51.450
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

28:51.470 --> 28:53.940
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

28:53.960 --> 28:57.070
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

28:54.640 --> 28:55.840
You both believe him.

28:57.760 --> 29:05.040
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

28:59.160 --> 29:00.310
I'm warning you,

29:01.960 --> 29:03.560
you might just end up like me.

29:05.250 --> 29:13.080
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

29:10.960 --> 29:12.360
Let's take Qiushui home.

29:27.200 --> 29:27.830
Mr. Qu,

29:28.200 --> 29:29.510
about today's incident...

29:29.510 --> 29:31.910
Xiao Qiushui has received due punishment.

29:32.350 --> 29:35.950
I believe all the sect leaders
will offer help to the Xiao family.

29:42.030 --> 29:43.750
Then the Hero Command Token...

29:43.750 --> 29:45.200
Mr. Qu will keep it safe

29:46.030 --> 29:47.960
and return it to Wudang Sect later.

29:48.510 --> 29:50.400
Any objections, guys?

29:51.640 --> 29:52.600
It's a good idea.

29:55.070 --> 29:56.130
If that's the case,

29:56.240 --> 29:58.920
I shall humbly accept this task.

30:06.640 --> 30:08.510
I already framed Xiao Qiushui

30:08.830 --> 30:10.480
as you told me.

30:11.030 --> 30:13.350
Please, Deputy Chief Liu,

30:13.920 --> 30:17.310
help me get rid of the Misery Pill.

30:17.960 --> 30:20.070
Xiao Qiushui's matter has been settled.

30:20.070 --> 30:21.800
But there is still a bone to pick

30:22.310 --> 30:23.440
for Baicao Valley.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.610
What did you say?

30:27.270 --> 30:30.270
How astounding
that you've completely forgotten it.

30:31.590 --> 30:33.450
Here's a little reminder for you.

30:33.680 --> 30:35.280
Maybe it'll jog your memory.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.160
You...

31:03.350 --> 31:03.880
Mother.

31:14.100 --> 31:16.210
You're the young valley master.

31:16.880 --> 31:18.000
I'm not only alive,

31:18.750 --> 31:21.000
but have also become what you fear most.

31:21.440 --> 31:22.840
You, hateful scoundrel,

31:22.880 --> 31:24.070
spread rumors,

31:24.460 --> 31:25.840
ruined Baicao Valley's reputation,

31:25.840 --> 31:27.570
and destroyed my whole family.

31:27.830 --> 31:30.090
You're finally in the palm of my hand now.

31:30.670 --> 31:33.240
I have nothing to do with
Baicao Valley's misfortune.

31:33.240 --> 31:33.790
Fine.

31:35.200 --> 31:37.530
Let's see
how long you can keep denying it.

32:10.640 --> 32:12.200
I didn't do it!

32:14.550 --> 32:17.110
I didn't spread those rumors!

32:17.550 --> 32:19.310
Stop this, I beg you!

32:19.550 --> 32:21.400
Stop...

32:25.240 --> 32:27.720
You're still in denial
as you're about to die.

32:27.720 --> 32:28.510
I swear...

32:29.350 --> 32:31.790
my task back then
was only to steal the formula.

32:31.790 --> 32:34.960
What happened afterward
was irrelevant to me.

32:35.480 --> 32:37.200
I was not engaged in it at all.

32:40.860 --> 32:42.720
What exactly happened back then?

32:42.750 --> 32:43.310
Tell me!

32:47.160 --> 32:47.960
Back then...

32:49.440 --> 32:52.920
Our army learned
that Baicao Valley in Jinzhong

32:53.160 --> 32:54.920
had developed a pill

32:55.510 --> 32:59.310
with remarkable effects for
addressing hunger and healing wounds.

32:59.790 --> 33:03.200
So, they planned to make Marching Pills
based on it as military provisions.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.110
Please leave.

33:04.310 --> 33:06.040
I won't sell the formula to you.

33:06.440 --> 33:07.030
Miss...

33:07.680 --> 33:08.240
Goodbye.

33:11.480 --> 33:12.010
Let's go.

33:14.870 --> 33:18.550
King Helian assigned me
to steal the formula from the valley.

33:19.400 --> 33:22.750
But since the master there
guarded the formula with great caution,

33:22.750 --> 33:26.410
I had no choice but to observe
the process of pill making in secret.

33:32.790 --> 33:33.880
Unexpectedly,

33:34.440 --> 33:35.550
I was spotted,

33:36.110 --> 33:37.550
and my identity exposed.

33:38.510 --> 33:41.640
I was then expelled from Baicao Valley.

33:43.790 --> 33:47.550
After that, those in the valley
became more vigilant.

33:48.400 --> 33:50.440
Outsiders could barely make their way in.

33:50.440 --> 33:53.700
Therefore, King Helian paid a man
in the Daxi martial world

33:54.160 --> 33:55.640
to be his informant

33:56.160 --> 33:59.000
and had this man look for the formula.

34:00.590 --> 34:04.590
It came as a shock that he started
spreading rumors in the martial world,

34:05.000 --> 34:09.530
claiming that Baicao Valley was making
Marching Pills exclusively for our army.

34:09.670 --> 34:11.000
The words reached far.

34:12.699 --> 34:17.620
Baicao Valley was then destroyed
by the Daxi martial world overnight.

34:17.920 --> 34:20.280
It was the Daxi martial world
that flattened Baicao Valley.

34:20.280 --> 34:22.250
It truly had nothing to do with me!

34:23.150 --> 34:26.080
Who was that martial practitioner
in collusion with

34:26.590 --> 34:28.190
you Northern Wastelanders?

34:30.000 --> 34:31.929
His identity is a military secret.

34:32.760 --> 34:34.760
It is known to no one but King Helian.

34:37.230 --> 34:38.800
How am I supposed to know

34:39.510 --> 34:40.770
if you're telling a lie

34:41.280 --> 34:42.610
to exonerate yourself?

34:42.920 --> 34:44.480
Every word I've said is true.

34:44.480 --> 34:45.800
I dare not lie.

34:47.310 --> 34:49.360
Oh, right. I recall it.

34:49.670 --> 34:52.870
It was Diancang Sect
that transported the Marching Pills

34:53.030 --> 34:54.560
to the Northern Wasteland.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.320
You can ask them about it.

34:56.880 --> 34:58.150
Diancang Sect...

34:59.480 --> 35:00.190
Good.

35:03.000 --> 35:04.550
Write down everything

35:05.110 --> 35:05.960
you just said.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.920
Okay. I will.

35:29.250 --> 35:31.550
[Xiao Residence]

35:47.590 --> 35:48.390
Qu Hanshan...

35:49.440 --> 35:50.240
Qu Hanshan...

35:50.960 --> 35:51.620
Qu Hanshan!

35:51.800 --> 35:52.510
Qiushui.

35:52.920 --> 35:53.630
Qiushui!

35:57.440 --> 35:58.190
Qiushui.

36:00.280 --> 36:01.810
I've sealed your acupoints

36:02.190 --> 36:03.300
to ease the pain.

36:03.710 --> 36:06.400
I've also applied some Healing Salve
to your wounds.

36:06.400 --> 36:08.360
The pain will somewhat subside.

36:11.710 --> 36:12.360
Yiren,

36:13.190 --> 36:13.840
Kaiyan,

36:15.030 --> 36:15.630
Xueyu,

36:17.030 --> 36:19.160
do not let Qu Hanshan go to Sword Manor.

36:20.030 --> 36:21.670
Please stop being so stubborn.

36:21.670 --> 36:22.960
Look at the state you're in now.

36:22.960 --> 36:24.620
Take it down a notch, will you?

36:24.710 --> 36:25.360
Kaiyan,

36:26.760 --> 36:30.280
Qu Hanshan is the Sword King
of the Power Gang.

36:31.320 --> 36:33.450
He got the Hero Command Token long ago.

36:33.920 --> 36:35.360
He made up that story today

36:35.360 --> 36:36.630
only to slander me.

36:37.280 --> 36:38.280
Enough.

36:39.000 --> 36:41.190
The Xiao family's century-old reputation

36:41.190 --> 36:43.390
was almost ruined today because of you.

36:43.510 --> 36:46.370
Fortunately,
Mr. Qu was kind and chivalrous enough

36:46.510 --> 36:47.510
to still choose to

36:48.150 --> 36:50.350
help our family despite what happened.

36:50.360 --> 36:51.110
Yiren,

36:52.280 --> 36:53.510
he agreed to help

36:54.210 --> 36:57.790
merely because the Sword Manor
can only be opened from inside.

36:59.760 --> 37:00.650
I've heard

37:01.920 --> 37:03.920
that Liu Suifeng from the Power Gang

37:04.510 --> 37:06.310
has a grudge against our family.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.400
Xueyu,

37:08.690 --> 37:11.090
if the Power Gang
gets into the Sword Manor,

37:12.190 --> 37:13.450
they'll bring nothing

37:14.630 --> 37:16.290
but harm to Father and Mother.

37:16.760 --> 37:17.630
How absurd.

37:18.550 --> 37:20.150
Our family has never had ties

37:20.190 --> 37:21.320
with the Power Gang.

37:21.800 --> 37:24.710
How is Liu Suifeng possibly
holding a grudge against us?

37:24.710 --> 37:26.710
I don't have time for your nonsense.

37:27.070 --> 37:28.870
We'll settle this matter later.

37:29.360 --> 37:29.960
Yiren,

37:31.500 --> 37:33.840
why do you believe
that outsider Qu Hanshan

37:33.840 --> 37:35.700
instead of your brother Qiushui?

37:37.880 --> 37:39.340
Qiushui needs to rest now.

37:39.480 --> 37:40.740
Let's not disturb him.

37:41.960 --> 37:43.160
Attend to his wounds.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.570
Get him caregivers.

37:44.880 --> 37:45.480
Yiren!

37:47.150 --> 37:47.880
Yiren!

37:49.920 --> 37:50.550
Yiren!

38:19.900 --> 38:20.610
Tang Fang?

38:57.670 --> 38:58.230
No!

39:42.710 --> 39:45.490
Was that dream a plot of the novel?

39:46.710 --> 39:49.360
The Sword Manor
is supposed to be impenetrable.

39:49.360 --> 39:52.690
Father and Mother said
the water could last them for 20 days.

39:53.630 --> 39:54.890
Do I remember it wrong?

39:55.510 --> 39:57.110
Or has something gone wrong?

40:37.510 --> 40:39.040
It's the key to Sword Manor.

40:39.280 --> 40:40.860
Such hot weather.

40:40.880 --> 40:42.230
Mother, mind the steps.

40:45.430 --> 40:46.490
Stop following me.

40:46.960 --> 40:48.030
I don't have the key.

40:48.030 --> 40:49.090
Your father has it.

40:50.110 --> 40:52.030
Mother, how do you know?

40:53.400 --> 40:55.160
I gave birth to you.

40:55.550 --> 40:56.750
Don't you think I know

40:56.880 --> 40:57.880
what you're up to?

40:58.400 --> 41:00.670
You want to open the Sword Manor
with the key,

41:00.670 --> 41:02.400
so you can get Changge Sword, right?

41:02.400 --> 41:05.150
Mother, you know me so well.

41:05.480 --> 41:07.800
Why not help me persuade Father

41:08.280 --> 41:10.070
to lend me the key just once?

41:10.360 --> 41:11.290
Lend you the key?

41:14.400 --> 41:15.070
Dream on!

41:17.670 --> 41:19.630
I wish I could help, Son.

41:20.070 --> 41:22.480
But your father
cares a lot about that key.

41:22.760 --> 41:24.110
According to our ancestors' rules,

41:24.110 --> 41:25.590
it must be with him till he dies.

41:25.590 --> 41:26.650
The only exception

41:26.920 --> 41:29.000
is that your father no longer
manages the Xiao family.

41:29.000 --> 41:31.930
Then, the key be passed down
to you and your brothers.

41:32.070 --> 41:34.150
The key must be with Father
till he dies...

41:34.150 --> 41:36.610
Why would Mother
put something so important

41:36.670 --> 41:38.110
in this pouch?
